<title>UK: No change in British government policy on EMU.</title>
<headline>No change in British government policy on EMU.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Foreign Secretary Malcolm Rifkind and Finance Minister Kenneth Clarke on Thursday denied any difference in policy over Britain's approach to a single European currency.</p>
<p>Government policy had not changed, they said in a statement.</p>
</text>
